# Portal worktree (Command Center WIP)

While `wip/hub-landing` is active, **do not** start portal Vite from `streamclone-pulse`.

| Task | Checkout | Branch |
|------|----------|--------|
| `/analytics`, Command Center, hub landing, portal QA | `C:\Users\Aron\streamclone-pulse-hub` | `wip/hub-landing` |
| Extension `src/` overlay | `C:\Users\Aron\streamclone-pulse` | whatever extension branch |

```bash
git -C C:/Users/Aron/streamclone-pulse-hub branch --show-current   # expect wip/hub-landing
cd C:/Users/Aron/streamclone-pulse-hub/streampulse-web
npm run dev   # or npm run dev:hosted
```

Both worktrees use port `:5173`. Kill any Vite started from the other tree before trusting `http://127.0.0.1:5173`. See `docs/contributing-wip-split.md` and `docs/website-portal/local-dev-runbook.md`.
